<title>INDONESIA: Troops disperse Moslems in Indonesia poll protest.</title>
<headline>Troops disperse Moslems in Indonesia poll protest.</headline>
<dateline>YOGYAKARTA, Indonesia 1997-05-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian soldiers wielding sticks dispersed a demonstration by Moslem youths in the central Javan city of Yogyakarta early on Sunday as tensions between contestants in Indonesia's election continued to rise.</p>
<p>Armed troops charged the protest by about 100 Moslem youths after they took to the street to express anger against a recent attack on the local offices of the Moslem-oriented United Development Party (PPP).</p>
